[{:db/id 17592186412491 :question/problem "Select the correct options in the truth table below and use this to determine whether $(¬A∧B)∧(A∧¬B)$ is a contradiction.\n\n| $\\,A\\,$ | $\\,B\\,$ | $\\,¬A∧B\\,$ | $\\,A∧¬B\\,$ | $\\,(¬A∧B)∧(A∧¬B)\\,$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ | {{field-1}} |\n| $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{T}$ | {{field-2}} |\n| $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{F}$ | {{field-3}} |\n| $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ | {{field-4}} |\n\nAccording to the table, $(¬A∧B)∧(A∧¬B)$ \n{{field-5}}\nalways false. Therefore, it \n{{field-6}} \na contradiction." :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id 17592186412490 :question/problem "Select the correct options in the truth table below and use this to determine whether $(P∧Q)∧(¬P∨Q)$ is a contradiction.\n\n| $\\,P\\,$ | $\\,Q\\,$ | $\\,P∧Q\\,$ | $\\,¬P∨Q\\,$ | $\\,(P∧Q)∧(¬P∨Q)\\,$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{T}$ | {{field-1}} |\n| $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ | {{field-2}} |\n| $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{T}$ | {{field-3}} |\n| $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{T}$ | {{field-4}} |\n\nAccording to the table, $(P∧Q)∧(¬P∨Q)$ \n{{field-5}}\nalways false. Therefore, it \n{{field-6}} \na contradiction." :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id 17592186412494 :question/problem "If $P$ is a statement, $\\text{t}$ is a tautology, and $\\text{c}$ is a contradiction, complete the following table of logical equivalences.\n\n| Statement | Is Logically Equivalent To |\n| --- | --- |\n| $\\text{t}∧\\text{c}$ | {{field-1}} |\n| $\\text{c}∨\\text{c}$ | {{field-2}} |\n| $\\text{c}∧¬P$ | {{field-3}} |\n| $P∨\\text{c}$ | {{field-4}} |" :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "activity-ca9805b2-0055-5f04-a805-328b01ff7cbb" :activity/id #uuid "ca9805b2-0055-5f04-a805-328b01ff7cbb" :activity/ti